================================

This distribution contains the software listed below. Each component is licensed under its own
licence, named here as its Maven POM declares it. Where a component offers a choice of licences,
all of them are listed. The jars keep their own META-INF licence and NOTICE files, inside
lib/idm-test-runner-<version>.jar (BOOT-INF/lib/).

runtime/ is a Java 25 runtime image built with jlink from an OpenJDK build (GNU General Public
License, version 2, with the Classpath Exception); its licence and notices are in runtime/legal/
and runtime/release.

lib/idm-test-runner-<version>.jar also contains the Spring Boot loader classes (Apache License,
Version 2.0).

